'── Build-plan mindmap body ───────────────────────────────────
' Shared by uml/build_plans/chNN.puml. Each of those sets $CH to its
' chapter number and includes this file; $cls() then marks every node
' as done (covered in an earlier chapter), current (this chapter's
' topic) or todo (still ahead).
'
' Mirrors uml/ch01/llm_agent_build_mental_model.puml. Keep the two in
' sync -- that one is the unannotated version used on the docs site.
'
' The bold border on `current` is applied here; the matching bold on
' the edges back to the root cannot be expressed in PlantUML (per-node
' arrow styling is a no-op) and is applied afterwards by
' _scripts/bold_current_path.py.

!include book-clean.puml

!function $cls($n)
  !if $CH == $n
    !return "current"
  !elseif $CH > $n
    !return "done"
  !else
    !return "todo"
  !endif
!endfunction

<style>
mindmapDiagram {
  ' 3.0 is exactly double PlantUML's 1.5 default, matching the
  ' hand-edited figures this replaces
  .current { LineThickness 3.0 }
  .done    { BackgroundColor #B8B8B8 }
  .todo    { }
}
</style>

